# Data & Private Prospects
# Keep schema, but ignore private sqlite db if containing personal contact info
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
data/*.db-journal

# Local drafts / archives
# (Uncomment if drafts contain proprietary/PII info)
# outreach/drafts/*.md
# outreach/sent/*.md
!outreach/drafts/.gitkeep
!outreach/sent/.gitkeep
!data/exports/.gitkeep
